Portal flow (Recalled — screenshots only, not machine output):
Same Salesforce enterprise app. Provisioning > Get started > New provisioning configuration.
"Admin credentials" form appeared directly — no licensing/upsell message, no gate before this
point. Entered junk values (username "test", password/secret token masked, Tenant URL
